{
  "id": "longest-valid-parentheses",
  "order": 57,
  "title": "Longest Valid Parentheses",
  "difficulty": "Hard",
  "pattern": "Stack",
  "statement": "Given a string `s` of `(` and `)`, return the length of its longest well-formed parentheses substring.",
  "constraints": [
    "0 <= s.length <= 3 * 10^4"
  ],
  "function": {
    "name": "longestValidParentheses",
    "params": [
      {
        "name": "s",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ],
    "returns": "int"
  },
  "complexity": {
    "time": "O(n)",
    "space": "O(n)"
  },
  "hints": [
    "Brute force checks every substring. What makes a valid run end?",
    "Push indices on a stack and keep the index of the last unmatched ')' as a base.",
    "Start the stack with -1. On '(' push i; on ')' pop, then push i if the stack is empty, else best = max(best, i - top)."
  ],
  "tests": [
    {
      "args": [
        "(()"
      ],
      "expected": 2,
      "hidden": false,
      "explanation": "\"()\"."
    },
    {
      "args": [
        ")()())"
      ],
      "expected": 4,
      "hidden": false,
      "explanation": "\"()()\"."
    },
    {
      "args": [
        ""
      ],
      "expected": 0,
      "hidden": false,
      "explanation": "0."
    },
    {
      "args": [
        "("
      ],
      "expected": 0,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        "()"
      ],
      "expected": 2,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        "()(()"
      ],
      "expected": 2,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        "(()())"
      ],
      "expected": 6,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        "))(("
      ],
      "expected": 0,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        ")(()())))("
      ],
      "expected": 6,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        "((()(()()"
      ],
      "expected": 4,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        "(()))())()))))(("
      ],
      "expected": 4,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        ")(((()))()("
      ],
      "expected": 8,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        ")((()())(())"
      ],
      "expected": 10,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        "(()(()())))("
      ],
      "expected": 10,
      "hidden": true
    }
  ]
}
